-- Source module: Solutions.J6SegEnt
/-!
# Segmented inverse (S2): single entries of the block inverse (capacitance corners)

`TinvI` evaluates `T⁻¹_{uv}` directly or through persymmetry (`TinvF_persym`), `MinvI`
evaluates `M⁻¹_{uv} = D_u T⁻¹_{uv} D_v⁻¹`.  With `K = (n+1)E + 1`, `100 K ≤ 2^P`:
